      "role": "user",
      "content": "its alright. im not asking for anything really. just... needed somewhere to put all this tonight.\n\nshe used to stay up with me when i couldnt sleep. we'd just sit in the kitchen, not even talking much. just there. i keep making two cups of tea out of habit and then just staring at the second one.\n\ni been thinking a lot lately about what the point of all this is. getting up, eating, going through the motions. for what. its not like anyone would notice much if i just... stopped.",
