    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that. \"you dont have to carry it alone.\" but honestly... i do. my kids have their own lives, their own problems. i dont want to be a burden on them. margaret wouldnt have wanted that either.\n\nsometimes i think she got the better end of it. she went peaceful, in her sleep, just... done. no more worrying, no more aching knees, no more loneliness. just done.\n\ni keep thinking maybe thats not the worst thing. just being done.",
